 "html": "<!--docxjs library predefined styles--><style>\n.blok-docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center; } \n.blok-docx-wrapper>section.blok-docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px; }\n.blok-docx { color: black; hyphens: auto; text-underline-position: from-font; }\nsection.blok-docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\nsection.blok-docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1; }\nsection.blok-docx>footer { z-index: 1; }\n.blok-docx table { border-collapse: collapse; }\n.blok-docx table td, .blok-docx table th { vertical-align: top; }\n.blok-docx p { margin: 0pt; min-height: 1em; }\n.blok-docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word; }\n.blok-docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit; }\n.blok-docx svg { fill: transparent; }\n</style><div class=\"blok-docx-wrapper\"><section class=\"blok-docx\" style=\"padding: 54pt; width: 612pt;\"><article><p style=\"margin-bottom: 12pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; min-height: 20pt; font-size: 20pt;\">Service Agreement</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span>This Service Agreement (\"Agreement\") is entered into as of June 16, 2026, by and between Blok Software Inc. (\"Provider\") and the undersigned client (\"Client\").</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1. Scope of Services</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span>Provider shall deliver and maintain the Blok block-based editor, including hosting, support, and periodic feature updates, for the duration of this Agreement.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2. Term</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span>This Agreement commences on the effective date above and continues for an initial term of twelve (12) months, renewing automatically unless either party provides thirty (30) days written notice.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3. Fees</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span>Client agrees to pay the monthly subscription fee set out in the order form. Fees are due within fifteen (15) days of each invoice date.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 14pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; min-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4. Confidentiality</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; line-height: 1.15;\"><span>Each party shall protect the other party’s confidential information with the same degree of care it uses for its own, and no less than reasonable care.</span></p><p><span><div style=\"width: 15pt; height: 15pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: 0px;\"><img style=\"position: relative; left: 0pt; top: 0pt; width: 15pt; height: 15pt;\" src=\"blob:#0\"></div></span></p></article></section></div>",
